73
00:03:24,878 --> 00:03:28,039
Right here. Oh. Okay. We can make it!
Go, go! Come on! Come on!

74
00:03:28,143 --> 00:03:29,871
We're gonna make it!
We're gonna make it!

75
00:03:29,967 --> 00:03:32,375
Out the door. Out the door.
Out the door. Whoo!

76
00:03:32,463 --> 00:03:34,326
