I'm already sweating. This is ridiculous.
Come on. Right now. Put 'em on. Do it quick.

103
00:04:53,107 --> 00:04:54,244
Put the clothes on.
Get 'em on. Okay!

104
00:04:56,908 --> 00:04:59,477
Here. Take the jacket. Get '.

