Your dad's never flown before.
Frankie, I'm begging you, shush. Be cool?

161
00:07:35,244 --> 00:07:37,323
I'm cool. I'm totally cool.
Okay. Thank you.

162
00:07:37,412 --> 00:07:40,028
<i>I hear we have a couple
